  m_text: "Instuctions:\r\n\r\nEnter the virtual supermarket to choose groceries
    for your dinner.\r\nYou are not holding a virtual shopping basket in your hand\r\n\r\nWalk
    through the aisles, look around, and select items you'd like to buy:\r\n\r\n\_*
    Press E to Interact and click \"Add to cart\"\r\n\_* Press K to view your cart
    and total items\r\n\r\nYou are only browsing in this virtual experience and you
    do not need to pay for any items\r\n\r\nExplore for 1 - 5 minutes. After 5 Minutes,
    the environment will close and you'll receive a code\r\n\r\nIf you finish early,
    press F to get the code. Then return to questionnaire to enter the code and answer
    the question"
